# NOTE: We KEEP the following for research reproducibility:
# - outputs/models/random_forest.pkl (35MB - small baseline model)
# - outputs/models/xgboost.pkl (1.7MB - small baseline model)
# - outputs/models/catboost.pkl (427KB - small baseline model)
# - outputs/reports/*.md (research documentation)
# - outputs/reports/*.csv (metrics - small text files)
# - outputs/classification_reports/*.txt (classification results)
# - outputs/plots/*.png (visualization - small images)
# - data/*.csv (dataset - if small, comment out if large)